{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f0d1a245a22b55e4","name":"Pseudograv Projector","source":{"id":"source:reference-f0d1a245a22b55e4","title":"Pseudograv Projector","revision":21413,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:45:32Z","sha256":"51de72d088be8ed749ccfe80cab66a4db5dc109c7c0884bbc0827c8447f9267d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21413","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Pseudograv%20Projector&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f0d1a245a22b55e4","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Pseudograv Projectors do not deal damage but instead produce a special effect. Projecting pseudograv waves is treated like firing a weapon in an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},"; the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," must choose a 2x2- or 3x3-square (",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"},") area within the generator's range and make an attack roll against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of 10. If successful, the Pseudograv Projector disrupts hyperspace in the target squares. Any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," that starts its turn in a square covered by a pseudograv field cannot activate its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"}," on that turn, and any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," passing through the target area in hyperspace immediately reverts to normal space.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
